  "description": "An open-source .NET library for validating data in a simple and intuitive way. You just need to call one of validation static method of the V class, passing the name of the data and its value. Then if the validation failed, the function returns an error message or an empty string if validation finished successfully. There are many available features to validate data, by type, by length, by format and more like: NotNull, Length, StartsWith, Email, Iban, Card Number,...",
